.TH SDL_SSE4_2_INTRINSICS 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_SSE4_2_INTRINSICS \- Defined if (and only if) the compiler supports Intel SSE4.2 intrinsics.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_intrin.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_SSE4_2_INTRINSICS 1
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
If this macro is defined, SDL will have already included
.BR <nmmintrin\[char46]h>

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

